type: software
title: "Automatic Qualitative Analysis Platform (AQA)"
abstract: >-
  Web application for LLM-assisted deductive coding of Spanish-language
  interview transcripts with locally run models, exact sentence-level
  quotations, findings editing with provenance, and built-in comparison
  against human coding.
